# Step 7a. The local users database (SQLite is the DATABASE_URL default) and the
# Auth0 credentials that point the app at a tenant. Both are per-developer.
# `.env` at the repo root configures the backend and the pdf-service;
# Web App/frontend/.env.local configures the frontend. The .env.example
# templates beside them are tracked.
Web App/backend/*.db
.env
.env.local
